abel class="twg-checkbox__label" for="userLoginKeepin"><input class="twg-checkbox__input input-user-login__keepin" type="checkbox" name="userLoginKeepin" id="userLoginKeepin" value="keepin"><span class="twg-checkbox__text">Keep me logged in</span></label></div><div class="twg-sign-in__forgot"><span class="twg-link twgbtn-show-forgot-password" title="Forgot your password?">Forgot your password?</span></div></div><div class="twg-account__panel-form-action"><button class="twgbtn full twgbtn-submit-login" type="button">Sign In</button></div></div></div><div class="twg-account__panel-register-info"><h3 class="twg-account__panel-title">CREATE A NEW ACCOUNT</h3><div class="twg-account__panel-description">Create an account and benefit from a more personal shopping experience, and quicker online checkout.</div><div class="twg-account__panel-action text-center"><a href="https://twgtea.com/en/my-account/register" class="twgbtn full bd">Register an account</a></div></div></div></div></div></div><!-- END: Account - Login --><!-- START: Account - Forgot password --><div class="twg-account__panel twg-account__panel-forgot-password"><div class="twg-account__panel-body"><div class="twg-account__panel-close"><div class="twg-account__panel-close-btn"><span class="i-arrow-x"></span></div></div><div class="twg-account__panel-content"><div class="twg-account__panel-content-block"><div class="twg-account__panel-main-content"><h3 class="twg-account__panel-title">Forgot your Password?</h3><div class="twg-account__panel-description">Please enter the email address you used for this account and we will send you your password.</div><div class="twg-account__panel-form twg-account__panel-form-forgot-password form-check-validate no-scroll-to-field"><div class="array-list-errors" data-errors="emty&&Please complete the mandatory fields"></div><div class="twg-form-confirm-forgot-field"><div class="twg-form-account__field"><input class="custom-input field-required input-user-login__forgot-password-email" type="email" id="userForgotPasswordEmail" name="userForgotPasswordEmail" placeholder="Email Address*" data-errors="email&&Invalid Email Address"></div></div><div class="twg-account__panel-form-action"><button class="twgbtn bd twgbtn-forgot-password-cancel" type="button">Cancel</button><button class="twgbtn twgbtn-forgot-password-submit" type="button">Send</button></div></div></div><div class="twg-account__panel-register-info"><h3 class="twg-account__panel-title">CREATE A NEW ACCOUNT</h3><div class="twg-account__panel-description">Create an account and benefit from a more personal shopping experience, and quicker online checkout.</div><div class="twg-account__panel-action text-center"><a href="https://twgtea.com/en/my-account/register" class="twgbtn full bd">Register an account</a></div></div></div></div></div></div><!-- END: Account - Forgot password --></div><!-- START: Account - Validation email --><div class="twg-modal twg-email-valid" id="accountEmailValidModal"><div class="twg-modal__inner"><div class="twg-modal__header"><span title="Close" class="twg-modal__close-btn"><span class="i-arrow-x"></span></span></div><div class="twg-modal__body"><div class="twg-form twg-form--active-email"><div class="twg-active-email"><div class="twg-form-account__title"><h5 class="twg-form-account__title-text">Please verify your email</h5></div><div class="twg-form-account__body"><div class="twg-active-email__notify"><p class="twg-active-email__content">We have sent an email to <strong class="email-txt">temporary@sample.com</strong></p><p class="twg-active-email__guide">Kindly validate your account to complete your registration.</p></div><div class="twg-active-email__warning"><p class="twg-active-email__warning-text">Do check your junk mail if you have not received the email.</p><div class="twg-form-account__action"><div class="twg-form-account__action-resend"><a class="twgbtn md twg-btn-resend" href="https://twgtea.com//en/activeaccount/resend" title="Resend">Resend</a></div><div class="twg-form-account__action-contact"><a class="link-contact" href="/our-locations" title="Contact us">Contact us</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><!-- END: Account - Validation email --><div class="my-modal__text" data-modal-wishlist-text="Wishlist." data-modal-wishlist-link="https://twgtea.com/en/wish-list" data-modal-wishlist-added="Product added to" data-modal-wishlist-removed="Product removed from" data-add-to-cart-failed="There is an error adding this product to your cart." data-add-to-cart-0-title="The quantity you&#39;ve added is 0" data-add-to-cart-0-desc="Kindly change the quantity to add this product to your cart."></div><!-- End: Navigation --><section class="twg-section-location-landing twg-section-body twg2-section "><div class="container"><div class="row row-header"><div class="col-lg-7"><div class="divtext"><h2 class="title font-amiri regular">LOCATIONS AROUND THE WORLD</h2><div class="text-w-5 mb:fs-12 dt:fs-19 font-dm-sans regular">In over 70 locations located in the heart of the thriving cosmopolitan city.</div></div></div><div class="col-lg-5"><div class="text-w-5 " style="margin-bottom:5px">Find a Location</div><select id="changeLocationFilter" class="custom-select select-redirect-href" search="Country / Region" data-label__="Country" search-in="2" data-class="select-full-box md" data-not-found="There are no matches for your search."><option value="" selected="selected">Country <option value="Australia" data-region="" data-image="" data-href="https://twgtea.com/en/locations/australia">Australia <option value="Cambodia" data-region="" data-image="" data-href="https://twgtea.com/en/locations/cambodia">Cambodia <option value="France" data-region="" data-image="" data-href="https://twgtea.com/en/locations/france">France <option value="Germany" data-region="" data-image="" data-href="https://twgtea.com/en/locations/germany">Germany <option value="Hong Kong" data-region="" data-image="https://media.twgtea.com/images/default-source/illustrations-icons/twg-logo/teawg(hk)_oval.png?sfvrsn=bf5239c6_2" data-href="https://twgtea.com/en/locations/hong-kong">Hong Kong <option value="India" data-region="" data-image="" data-href="https://twgtea.com/en/locations/india">India <option value="Indonesia" data-region="" data-image="" data-href="https://twgtea.com/en/locations/indonesia">Indonesia <option value="Japan" data-region="" data-image="" data-href="https://twgtea.com/en/locations/japan">Japan <option value="Korea" data-region="" data-image="" data-href="https://twgtea.com/en/locations/korea">Korea <option value="Kuwait" data-region="" data-image="" data-href="https://twgtea.com/en/locations/kuwait">Kuwait <option value="Luxembourg" data-region="" data-image="" data-href="https://twgtea.com/en/locations/luxembourg">Luxembourg <option value="Macau" data-region="" data-image="" data-href="https://twgtea.com/en/locations/macau">Macau <option value="Malaysia" data-region="" data-image="" data-href="https://twgtea.com/en/locations/malaysia">Malaysia <option value="Mongolia" data-region="" data-image="" data-href="https://twgtea.com/en/locations/mongolia">Mongolia <option value="Portugal" data-region="" data-image="" data-href="https://twgtea.com/en/locations/portugal">Portugal <option value="Saudi Arabia" data-region="" data-image="" data-href="https://twgtea.com/en/locations/saudi-arabia">Saudi Arabia <option value="Singapore" data-region="" data-image="" data-href="https://twgtea.com/en/locations/singapore">Singapore <option value="Spain" data-region="" data-image="" data-href="https://twgtea.com/en/locations/spain">Spain <option value="Taiwan" data-region="" data-image="" data-href="https://twgtea.com/en/locations/taiwan">Taiwan <option value="Thailand" data-region="" data-image="" data-href="https://twgtea.com/en/locations/thailand">Thailand <option value="United Arab Emirates" data-region="" data-image="" data-href="https://twgtea.com/en/locations/united-arab-emirates">United Arab Emirates <option value="United Kingdom" data-region="" data-image="" data-href="https://twgtea.com/en/locations/united-kingdom">United Kingdom <option value="Vietnam" data-region="" data-image="" data-href="https://twgtea.com/en/locations/vietnam">Vietnam </select></div></div><div class="row row-gap-30 center row-content end"><div class="col-lg-7"><div class="img"><img class="lazy-hidden" data-lazy-type="image" data-lazy-src="https://media.twgtea.com/images/default-source/locations/locations/singapore/ion_front.webp?sfvrsn=68b76d3d_2"></div></div><div class="col-lg-5"><div class="divtext"><div class="descriptionTitle font-amiri regular"> Discover TWG Tea Salons &amp; Boutiques </div><div class="desc font-dm-sans regular"> TWG Tea Salons & Boutiques are designed to elevate the luxury retail and tea gastronomy experience. Blending heritage and modernity, guests are transported through time with a harmonious mix of dark polished wood with gold trimmings, burnished brass, and Italian marble – a welcoming escape from the rush of the day.<br><br>Guests can expect the same luxurious experience wherever they are, with a selection of loose-leaf teas alongside a full collection of packaged teas and gift sets, all carefully curated to appeal to every predilection, mood and time of day.<br><br>Choose your preferred location and indulge in a reviving cup of tea or tea-infused gourmet delicacies, or treat yourself to the sight of whimsical packaging and exquisite tea wall – a charming invitation to savour everyday moments with TWG Tea. </div></div></div></div><input type="text" id="txtTitleHeader" hidden="" value="TWG Locations"></div></section><input id="footer-option-select" type="hidden" value="footer-collapsed"><div id="div-selection-shipping" class="no-scroll-to-field" data-bls-script="data-bls-script" data-src="/App_Data/Sitefinity/WebsiteTemplate/TWGTea/App_JS/widgets/twg-tea-selection-shipping.min.js"><span class="div-overlay-modal"></span><div class="content-selection-shipping 